{"about":"ATAC bus line 81. Stops, positions, route and timetable from Rome's official GTFS feed (romamobilita.it), downloaded 13 November 2026. Notes on what is near each stop and the trips worth taking were written for this trip. Timetable times are scheduled, not live.","line":{"number":"81","operator":"ATAC","termini":["Crescenzio/Risorgimento (Prati, by the Vatican)","Malatesta (Metro C, east Rome)"],"runs":"Daily, roughly 05:30 to midnight","frequency":"About every 13 to 24 minutes on weekdays and 17 to 24 at weekends, per third-party timetables. On 13 Nov 2026 at 18:00 departures from the terminus were 18 minutes apart.","full_journey_minutes":"65 to 80","why_it_matters":"It stops on Via Cicerone, Hotel Isa's street, and runs straight to Piazza Navona and the Pantheon, Largo Argentina, the Capitoline, the Circus Maximus and Aventine, and the Colosseum. It links both hotels and most of Saturday's route with no changes."},"alerts":["Piazza Venezia: route modification","Piazza Venezia: Metro C station works"],"alerts_date":"13 November 2026","alerts_note":"Both alerts concern the Piazza Venezia area, between Largo Argentina and the Capitoline. The stop list was unchanged on 13 Nov, but check live before relying on that stretch.","tickets":{"how":"Tap a contactless bank card on the reader when you board, or buy a paper ticket beforehand from a tobacconist or metro station and stamp it on board. Tickets aren't sold on the bus.","check":true},"etiquette":["Board at any door; stops are request-only, so press the button before yours and wave from the stop to flag the bus down.","Stop names are shown on the pole. The name is the street, not the landmark.","Watch your pockets on crowded buses through the centre."],"trips":[{"when":"Any day","from":"Cicerone/Cavour or Cicerone/Plinio","to":"Rinascimento","towards":"Malatesta","stops":5,"minutes":"about 10","for":"Piazza Navona, the Pantheon, Saturday evening's neighbourhood"},{"when":"Sat 21, 10:00","from":"Cicerone/Cavour","to":"Rinascimento","towards":"Malatesta","stops":5,"minutes":"about 10","for":"The hotel move: drop bags at Albergo Abruzzi, 5 minutes' walk from the stop. A taxi is easier with luggage."},{"when":"Sat 21, 17:00","from":"Circo Massimo/Roseto Comunale (opposite side of the road)","to":"Rinascimento","towards":"Risorgimento","minutes":"about 15","for":"Back from the Orange Garden to Albergo Abruzzi instead of a taxi. Confirm the return stop name."},{"when":"Thu 19 morning","from":"Cicerone/Plinio (opposite side)","to":"Crescenzio/Risorgimento","towards":"Risorgimento","minutes":"about 8","for":"St Peter's and the Vatican Museums. It's also a 15-minute walk."},{"when":"Fri 20 evening","from":"Cicerone/Cavour","to":"C.so Vittorio Emanuele/Argentina","towards":"Malatesta","stops":6,"minutes":"about 12","for":"Change to tram 8 for Trastevere. Verify the tram stop and that the tram is running."},{"when":"Late evenings from the centre","from":"Rinascimento area","to":"Cicerone stops","towards":"Risorgimento","minutes":"about 10","for":"Home to Hotel Isa until about midnight. Service thins out late; have a taxi fallback."}],"live":{"stop":"https://romamobile.it/paline/palina/{stop_id}","line":"https://romamobile.it/paline/linea/81","source":"Roma mobile is an open-source project built on open data from Roma Servizi per la Mobilità (romamobilita.it/it/tecnologie/open-data). It is not an ATAC service."},"dirs":[{"to":"Malatesta (MC)","stops":[["Crescenzio/Risorgimento","83180",41.90597,12.45905,0,"Terminus. Piazza del Risorgimento: Vatican Museums entrance 6 minutes' walk, St Peter's Square 8. Be.Re. + Trapizzino is on the piazza.",1],["Cola Di Rienzo/Catone","70352",41.90649,12.45955,0,"Prati's main shopping street.",0],["Cola Di Rienzo/Terenzio","70353",41.90741,12.46349,2],["Cola Di Rienzo/Tacito","70354",41.90819,12.46654,4],["Cicerone/Plinio","70258",41.90756,12.46835,5,"On Hotel Isa's street (Via Cicerone 39). One of the two stops nearest the hotel.",1],["Cicerone/Cavour","70259",41.9061,12.46917,6,"On Hotel Isa's street, at the Piazza Cavour end. The other stop nearest the hotel.",1],["Vittoria Colonna","70261",41.90502,12.47231,8,"Last stop in Prati before the bus crosses the Tiber.",0],["Ripetta","70262",41.90405,12.47523,10,"Ara Pacis and the Mausoleum of Augustus. Piazza del Popolo is 8 minutes' walk north.",0],["Monte Brianzo","70263",41.90281,12.47405,12],["Zanardelli","70474",41.901,12.47223,14,"North end of Piazza Navona.",0],["Rinascimento","70266",41.898,12.47393,16,"Corso del Rinascimento. Piazza Navona 2 minutes, San Luigi dei Francesi 2 minutes, the Pantheon and Albergo Abruzzi 5 minutes.",1],["C.so Vittorio Emanuele/Argentina","79790",41.89618,12.47601,18,"Largo Argentina. Campo de' Fiori 5 minutes, Roscioli 5 minutes, Pizza Florida beside the stop. Tram 8 to Trastevere leaves from near here.",1],["Via Torre Argentina","79711",41.89506,12.47635,19],["Botteghe Oscure","30946",41.89481,12.47931,21,"Edge of the Ghetto.",0],["Teatro Marcello/Ara Coeli","70540",41.89311,12.48116,23,"Foot of the Capitoline steps and the Altar of the Fatherland. Theatre of Marcellus 3 minutes.",1],["Petroselli","70543",41.89025,12.48071,25,"Theatre of Marcellus, Ponte Fabricio and Tiber Island.",1],["Greca","70545",41.88752,12.48159,27,"Bocca della Verità and the two Republican temples.",0],["Circo Massimo/Roseto Comunale","70547",41.88495,12.48535,30,"Foot of the Aventine. The Orange Garden and Santa Sabina are 8 minutes' walk uphill.",1],["Circo Massimo (MB)","70549",41.88406,12.48692,31,"Metro B. East end of the Circus Maximus.",0],["S. Gregorio","72066",41.88766,12.49022,35,"Palatine entrance on Via di San Gregorio.",0],["Celio Vibenna","70816",41.88907,12.4927,36,"The Colosseum stop: the Arch of Constantine and the entrance are in front of you.",1],["Claudia/Colosseo","71104",41.8881,12.49408,38,"Also for the Colosseum, slightly uphill. San Clemente 6 minutes.",1],["Claudia/Celio (H)","71107",41.88639,12.49495,39],["Navicella/Vil